{"v":4,"catch":"怒吼吧，Beam Katana！\n戰鬥吧，特拉維斯！","desc":"傳奇遊戲軟體—the Death Drive Mark\n特拉維斯徘徊在遊戲世界中，並踏上一場百年難遇的鬧劇。本次作品包括了動作遊戲，賽車，拼圖...共有七種不同的遊戲！\n特色：\n有Beam Katana在手上，特拉維斯誓要消除他發現的每一個Bug。把基本攻擊和技能串連起來，以將其消滅。\n每個關卡都潛伏著一個兇殘的BOSS。運用靈活的身手去擊倒他們！\n集齊七個Death Balls就可以得到一個願望。想要任何東西都可以，所以一定要收集它們！\n將Joy-Con給朋友以進行多人協力遊戲——甚至與唯一的大壞蛋搭檔！\n此外，還有一個關於全新故事的冒險模式！\nTravis Strikes Again：No More Heroes，Nintendo Switch獨家享有。","publisher":"Grasshopper Manufacture","release":"2025-09-29","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 7.8GB / Switch 7.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3cbb8f6db56e82436b12e20b3780e3c05acfb9c06c5f40b7bdee35291421722d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f370e2a4b834b5066c130245f00c4912f991673efe4dbf8a6818ea13be8a75f5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8da93ce00cd1fa42b0a0d8c001c8f1c8760e61597aa6e5a14f3c93e50b2b50ab.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/95a102daf459f23b50be5aa3ab1086faafa01ae235fdd7c0dc2a2eec6facd090.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/73cfdef82d0ac8a222fec014167bc176f831e2181ef2fca24aeba1ce015a712a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3a1932b55c39eb21a2a27176caf2885fdbd0641eaf5c7b5b45939d990821fc43.jpg"],"titleId":"010011600c946000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000064211","name":"新增內容第一彈 Black Dandelion","img":"a65a2085debe248c9bf3c6564602b7bb6ad7d5d57b1525ee06a7c69554e0f781","date":"2025-09-29","mem":false},{"id":"70050000064212","name":"新增內容第二彈 Bubblegum Fatale","img":"027111e7449f37aa9c9cb141c52a50341d52dca33a9e4a156c56f1aa401cd79b","date":"2025-09-29","mem":false}]}